SELECT define_rule($q${"rule_id": "BSC.bsc_rr_ao1_side_rear_setback", "instrument_version": "BSC_PLANNING_SCHEME_2020@2020-02-07", "topic": "SETBACK.SIDE", "title": "Table 6.2.3.2 PO1/AO1", "role": "REQUIREMENT", "regime": "PLANNING", "enforceability": "DEEMED_TO_COMPLY", "provision_kind": "ACCEPTABLE_OUTCOME", "measurement": "SCHEME_SETBACK_SIDE", "operator": ">=", "value": {"op": "unencoded", "text": "setback >= 20 if boundary is to a State-controlled road else >= 6", "extracted_value": 6, "extracted_operator": "conditional"}, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "PLANNING_APPROVAL_REQUIRED", "effective_from": "2020-02-07", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "BURKE"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BSC:RURAL_RESIDENTIAL"}], "subjects": ["ANY"], "sources": [{"key": "bsc_rr_ao1_side_rear_setback", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"side and rear setback\", \"operator\": \"conditional\", \"value\": 6, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"applies to side AND rear boundaries\", \"20m from a State-controlled road\", \"otherwise 6m from all boundaries\"], \"exceptions\": [], \"formula_text\": \"setback >= 20 if boundary is to a State-controlled road else >= 6\"}\nStructure scope 'Buildings and structures' mapped by keyword to ['ANY']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: NO - not designated as a QDC alternative provision. Section 1.6(3) states only that \"This planning scheme, through Part 5, regulates building work in accordance with Sections 32 and 33 of the Building Act 1975\"; Table 5.8 (building work) makes building work code assessable only for local heritage places and airport operational airspace (benchmark Table 7.2.1.3). This AO applies to code assessable material change of use, not to building work.\nResearcher notes: Zone code applies only to assessable development: a Dwelling house in this zone is accepted development subject to