SELECT define_rule($q${"rule_id": "BSC.bsc_gdc_t7214_township_no_precinct_front", "instrument_version": "BSC_PLANNING_SCHEME_2020@2020-02-07", "topic": "SETBACK.FRONTAGE", "title": "Table 7.2.1.4 (via Table 7.2.1.1 PO5/AO5)", "role": "REQUIREMENT", "regime": "PLANNING", "enforceability": "DEEMED_TO_COMPLY", "provision_kind": "TABLE", "measurement": "SCHEME_SETBACK_FRONT", "operator": ">=", "value": 6, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "PLANNING_APPROVAL_REQUIRED", "effective_from": "2020-02-07", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "BURKE"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "BSC:TOWNSHIP"}], "subjects": ["ANY"], "sources": [{"key": "bsc_gdc_t7214_township_no_precinct_front", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"front setback\", \"operator\": \">=\", \"value\": 6, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"corner lot: 6m from the primary street frontage\", \"primary street frontage is that nominated by Council\"], \"exceptions\": [\"does not apply to Dwelling houses (incl. their domestic outbuildings), Dual occupancies or Multiple dwellings\", \"assessable development only\"], \"formula_text\": null}\nStructure scope 'Buildings and structures (all uses excluding Dwelling houses, Dual occupancies and Multiple dwellings)' mapped by keyword to ['ANY']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: NO - not designated as a QDC alternative provision (s1.6(3) / Table 5.8 regulate building work only for heritage and airport airspace). AO5 applies only to assessable development for uses other than Dwelling houses, Dual occupancies and Multiple dwellings.\nResearcher notes: Applies via General development code AO5 (Table 7.2.1.1, under the headings \"For assessable development\" and \"All uses excluding Dwelling houses, Dual occupancies and Multiple dwellings\"). It therefore does NOT reach domestic outbuildings (sheds, garages, carports) of a Dwelling house; it reaches Class 10 buildings/structures only when part of another assessable use (e.g. caretaker's accommodation, home based business, non-residential uses). AO5 yields to a zone code prescription (\"Unless otherwise prescribed in a zone code\"). Site coverage and height columns omitted from verbatim_text (out of scope). Corresponding AO5 text: PO5 Buildings and structures are setback from the front, side and rear boundaries generally consistent with: • the intended form, function and character of development in the respective zone or zone precinct; and • prevailing setbacks of existing development in the same zone or zone precinct in the locality; and • amenity outcomes for adjoining development, streetscapes and public spaces. | AO5 Unless otherwise prescribed in a zone code, or other Acceptable outcome within the General development code, development provides setbacks in accordance with Table 7.2.1.4 – Building heights, setbacks and site coverage."}$q$::jsonb);
